<Layout title="Commercial Projects | ATECT Architecture" description="Commercial architecture and construction-document work by ATECT Architecture, including the Mariner Finance fit-out project.">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="eyebrow">Commercial Projects</div><h1>Commercial spaces planned for function and compliance.</h1><p>ATECT's commercial work includes construction documents, interior fit-outs, project coordination and permitting support.</p></section>
<section class="section"><article class="commercial-card"><div class="commercial-image" style="background-image:url('https://static.wixstatic.com/media/9aae58f8cb39c0432380467cfa4e74eb.jpg/v1/fill/w_1600,h_1000,al_c,q_90,enc_auto/9aae58f8cb39c0432380467cfa4e74eb.jpg')" role="img" aria-label="ATECT Blueprint Design project image"></div><div class="commercial-copy"><div class="eyebrow">Waldorf, Maryland & Richmond, Virginia</div><h2>Mariner Finance</h2><p>ATECT delivered a comprehensive set of construction documents for interior fit-outs at two locations. The work addressed current building regulations and ADA requirements while creating functional office environments.</p><p>The project included a breakroom, an ADA-compliant bathroom with a dedicated mop-sink area, and a new Hi-lo drinking fountain. ATECT also provided project management, coordination and permitting support.</p></div></article></section>
<section class="section alt"><a class="button dark" href="/contact">Discuss a Commercial Project</a></section>
</Layout>
<style is:global>.commercial-card{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;border:1px solid #ddd;background:#fff}.commercial-image{min-height:520px;background-size:cover;background-position:center}.commercial-copy{padding:42px}.commercial-copy h2{font:600 clamp(32px,4vw,52px)/1.05 Manrope;margin:0 0 18px}.commercial-copy p{color:#555;line-height:1.75}@media(max-width:800px){.commercial-card{grid-template-columns:1fr}.commercial-image{min-height:360px}}</style>
